<https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/cocktail/halloween-punch> a drink:Cocktail ;
    rdfs:label "Halloween Punch" ;
    dcterms:identifier "178313" ;
    dcterms:source <https://www.thecocktaildb.com/api/json/v1/1/lookup.php?i=178313> ;
    foaf:depiction <https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/7hcgyj1571687671.jpg> ;
    drink:baseSpirit <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/spirit/vodka> ;
    drink:hasTag "Halloween" ;
    drink:preparation """Tip the cherry juice, orange peel, chilli, cinnamon sticks, cloves and ginger into a large saucepan. Simmer for 5 mins, then turn off the heat. Leave to cool, then chill for at least 4 hrs, or up to 2 days – the longer you leave it the more intense the flavours. If serving to young children, take the chilli out after a few hours.\r
\r
When you’re ready to serve, pour the juice into a jug. Serve in glass bottles or glasses and pop a straw in each. If you're adding vodka, do so at this stage. Dangle a fangs sweet from each glass.""" ;
    drink:servedIn <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/glass/punch-bowl> ;
    drink:usesIngredient <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/halloween-punch/1>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/halloween-punch/2>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/halloween-punch/3>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/halloween-punch/4>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/halloween-punch/5>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/halloween-punch/6> ;
    schema:description """Tip the cherry juice, orange peel, chilli, cinnamon sticks, cloves and ginger into a large saucepan. Simmer for 5 mins, then turn off the heat. Leave to cool, then chill for at least 4 hrs, or up to 2 days – the longer you leave it the more intense the flavours. If serving to young children, take the chilli out after a few hours.\r
\r
When you’re ready to serve, pour the juice into a jug. Serve in glass bottles or glasses and pop a straw in each. If you're adding vodka, do so at this stage. Dangle a fangs sweet from each glass.""" ;
    schema:image <https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/7hcgyj1571687671.jpg> ;
    schema:name "Halloween Punch" .

