<https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/cocktail/mauresque> a drink:Cocktail ;
    rdfs:label "Mauresque" ;
    dcterms:identifier "178370" ;
    dcterms:source <https://www.thecocktaildb.com/api/json/v1/1/lookup.php?i=178370> ;
    foaf:depiction <https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/duwfa11686236556.jpg> ;
    drink:preparation """1 - Pour the Ricard (or pastis)
2 - Pour the orgeat syrup
3 - Finally pour the water and add ice cubes at your convenience.

Add the ice cubes at the end, otherwise the syrup and pastis do not mix well.""" ;
    drink:servedIn <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/glass/collins-glass> ;
    drink:usesIngredient <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/mauresque/1>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/mauresque/2>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/mauresque/3> ;
    schema:description """1 - Pour the Ricard (or pastis)
2 - Pour the orgeat syrup
3 - Finally pour the water and add ice cubes at your convenience.

Add the ice cubes at the end, otherwise the syrup and pastis do not mix well.""" ;
    schema:image <https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/duwfa11686236556.jpg> ;
    schema:name "Mauresque" .

<https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/cocktail/melya> a drink:Cocktail ;
    rdfs:label "Melya" ;
    dcterms:identifier "12776" ;
    dcterms:source <https://www.thecocktaildb.com/api/json/v1/1/lookup.php?i=12776> ;
    foaf:depiction <https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/xwtptq1441247579.jpg> ;
    drink:preparation "Brew espresso. In a coffee mug, place 1 teaspoon of unsweetened powdered cocoa, then cover a teaspoon with honey and drizzle it into the cup. Stir while the coffee brews, this is the fun part. The cocoa seems to coat the honey without mixing, so you get a dusty, sticky mass that looks as though it will never mix. Then all at once, presto! It looks like dark chocolate sauce. Pour hot espresso over the honey, stirring to dissolve. Serve with cream." ;
    drink:servedIn <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/glass/coffee-mug> ;
    drink:usesIngredient <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/melya/1>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/melya/2>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/melya/3> ;
    schema:description "Brew espresso. In a coffee mug, place 1 teaspoon of unsweetened powdered cocoa, then cover a teaspoon with honey and drizzle it into the cup. Stir while the coffee brews, this is the fun part. The cocoa seems to coat the honey without mixing, so you get a dusty, sticky mass that looks as though it will never mix. Then all at once, presto! It looks like dark chocolate sauce. Pour hot espresso over the honey, stirring to dissolve. Serve with cream." ;
