    schema:description "Mix with a bit of milk (1 oz or so) in coffee mug. Nuke mug for about 30-50 seconds. Stir until the heated cocoa dissolves. Fill mug with milk. Nuke for 1-2 minutes, depending on wattage and preferences as to burnt mouth parts." ;
    schema:image <https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/xcu6nb1487603142.jpg> ;
    schema:name "Nuked Hot Chocolate" .

