<https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/cocktail/ramos-gin-fizz> a drink:Cocktail ;
    rdfs:label "Ramos Gin Fizz" ;
    dcterms:identifier "178367" ;
    dcterms:source <https://www.thecocktaildb.com/api/json/v1/1/lookup.php?i=178367> ;
    foaf:depiction <https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/967t911643844053.jpg> ;
    drink:baseSpirit <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/spirit/gin> ;
    drink:preparation """Prepare all the ingredients on the counter to be able to work well and quickly, especially the cream and egg white.\r
\r
Pour all the ingredients into a shaker.\r
\r
Shake vigorously for 1 minute: cream and egg white must be mixed perfectly, so don't rush.\r
\r
Now open the shaker and put some ice and shake for 1-2 minutes. It depends on how long you can resist!\r
\r
Pour into a highball glass, add a splash of soda and garnish to taste.\r
\r
Ramos Gin Fizz was once drunk as an invigorating drink or even as a breakfast, try it as an aperitif and after dinner and you will discover a little gem now lost.""" ;
    drink:servedIn <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/glass/highball-glass> ;
    drink:usesIngredient <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/ramos-gin-fizz/1>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/ramos-gin-fizz/2>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/ramos-gin-fizz/3>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/ramos-gin-fizz/4>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/ramos-gin-fizz/5>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/ramos-gin-fizz/6>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/ramos-gin-fizz/7> ;
    schema:description """Prepare all the ingredients on the counter to be able to work well and quickly, especially the cream and egg white.\r
\r
Pour all the ingredients into a shaker.\r
\r
Shake vigorously for 1 minute: cream and egg white must be mixed perfectly, so don't rush.\r
\r
Now open the shaker and put some ice and shake for 1-2 minutes. It depends on how long you can resist!\r
\r
Pour into a highball glass, add a splash of soda and garnish to taste.\r
\r
Ramos Gin Fizz was once drunk as an invigorating drink or even as a breakfast, try it as an aperitif and after dinner and you will discover a little gem now lost.""" ;
    schema:image <https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/967t911643844053.jpg> ;
    schema:name "Ramos Gin Fizz" .

