    drink:baseSpirit <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/spirit/vodka> ;
    drink:preparation """Wash and cut 1 wedge and 1 slice of lime or lemon.\r
Fill a tumbler with fresh ice.\r
Pour the desired dose of vodka and top up with the tonic.\r
Squeeze the lime wedge into the glass and decorate with the slice.\r
That's all, very simple: it's just the recipe for happiness!""" ;
    drink:servedIn <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/glass/highball-glass> ;
