<https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/cocktail/zombie> a drink:Cocktail ;
    rdfs:label "Zombie" ;
    dcterms:identifier "17241" ;
    dcterms:source <https://www.thecocktaildb.com/api/json/v1/1/lookup.php?i=17241> ;
    foaf:depiction <https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/2en3jk1509557725.jpg> ;
    drink:baseSpirit <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/spirit/rum> ;
    drink:preparation """Blend at high speed for no more than 5 seconds.

Pour into a glass, add ice cubes to fill, then add the garnish.

*Donn’s mix: Bring 3 crushed cinnamon sticks, 1 cup of sugar and 1 cup of water to a boil, stirring until the sugar is dissolved.

Simmer for 2 minutes, then remove from the heat and let sit for at least 2 hours before straining into a clean glass bottle.

Then add 1 part of the syrup and 2 parts of fresh grapefruit juice together.""" ;
    drink:servedIn <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/glass/hurricane-glass> ;
    drink:usesIngredient <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/zombie/1>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/zombie/2>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/zombie/3>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/zombie/4>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/zombie/5>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/zombie/6>,
        <https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/zombie/7> ;
    schema:description """Blend at high speed for no more than 5 seconds.

Pour into a glass, add ice cubes to fill, then add the garnish.

*Donn’s mix: Bring 3 crushed cinnamon sticks, 1 cup of sugar and 1 cup of water to a boil, stirring until the sugar is dissolved.

Simmer for 2 minutes, then remove from the heat and let sit for at least 2 hours before straining into a clean glass bottle.

Then add 1 part of the syrup and 2 parts of fresh grapefruit juice together.""" ;
    schema:image <https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/2en3jk1509557725.jpg> ;
    schema:name "Zombie" .

